{"n":66,"name":"At-Tahrim","nameAr":"التحريم","meaning":"The Prohibition","ayahs":12,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ لِمَ تُحَرِّمُ مَآ أَحَلَّ ٱللَّهُ لَكَ ۖ تَبْتَغِى مَرْضَاتَ أَزْوَٰجِكَ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en":"O Prophet, why do you prohibit [yourself from] what Allāh has made lawful for you, seeking the approval of your wives? And Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","w":[{"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","tr":"yāayyuhā","en":"O","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","tr":"l-nabiyu","en":"Prophet","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبِيّ"},{"ar":"لِمَ","tr":"lima","en":"Why (do)"},{"ar":"تُحَرِّمُ","tr":"tuḥarrimu","en":"you prohibit","root":"حرم","lem":"حَرَّمَ"},{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"أَحَلَّ","tr":"aḥalla","en":"has made lawful","root":"حلل","lem":"أَحَلَّ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَكَ ۖ","tr":"laka","en":"for you"},{"ar":"تَبْتَغِى","tr":"tabtaghī","en":"seeking","root":"بغي","lem":"ابْتَغَى"},{"ar":"مَرْضَاتَ","tr":"marḍāta","en":"(to) please","root":"رضو","lem":"مَرْضات"},{"ar":"أَزْوَٰجِكَ ۚ","tr":"azwājika","en":"your wives","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","tr":"ghafūrun","en":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","root":"غفر","lem":"غَفُور"},{"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","tr":"raḥīmun","en":"Most Merciful","root":"رحم","lem":"رَحِيم"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"قَدْ فَرَضَ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ تَحِلَّةَ أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَلِيمُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en":"Allāh has already ordained for you [Muslims] the dissolution of your oaths. And Allāh is your protector, and He is the Knowing, the Wise.","w":[{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"فَرَضَ","tr":"faraḍa","en":"has ordained","root":"فرض","lem":"فَرَضَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"for you"},{"ar":"تَحِلَّةَ","tr":"taḥillata","en":"(the) dissolution","root":"حلل","lem":"تَحِلَّة"},{"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنِكُمْ ۚ","tr":"aymānikum","en":"(of) your oaths","root":"يمن","lem":"يَمِين"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۖ","tr":"mawlākum","en":"(is) your Protector","root":"ولي","lem":"مَوْلَى"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"and He"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","tr":"l-ʿalīmu","en":"(is) the All-Knower","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِيم"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","tr":"l-ḥakīmu","en":"the All-Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":3,"juz":28,"ar":"وَإِذْ أَسَرَّ ٱلنَّبِىُّ إِلَىٰ بَعْضِ أَزْوَٰجِهِۦ حَدِيثًا فَلَمَّا نَبَّأَتْ بِهِۦ وَأَظْهَرَهُ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ عَرَّفَ بَعْضَهُۥ وَأَعْرَضَ عَنۢ بَعْضٍ ۖ فَلَمَّا نَبَّأَهَا بِهِۦ قَالَتْ مَنْ أَنۢبَأَكَ هَـٰذَا ۖ قَالَ نَبَّأَنِىَ ٱلْعَلِيمُ ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en":"And [remember] when the Prophet confided to one of his wives a statement; and when she informed [another] of it and Allāh showed it to him, he made known part of it and ignored a part. And when he informed her about it, she said, \"Who told you this?\" He said, \"I was informed by the Knowing, the Aware.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذْ","tr":"wa-idh","en":"And when"},{"ar":"أَسَرَّ","tr":"asarra","en":"confided","root":"سرر","lem":"أَسَرَّ"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","tr":"l-nabiyu","en":"the Prophet","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبِيّ"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"بَعْضِ","tr":"baʿḍi","en":"one","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"أَزْوَٰجِهِۦ","tr":"azwājihi","en":"(of) his wives","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"حَدِيثًۭا","tr":"ḥadīthan","en":"a statement","root":"حدث","lem":"حَدِيث"},{"ar":"فَلَمَّا","tr":"falammā","en":"and when"},{"ar":"نَبَّأَتْ","tr":"nabba-at","en":"she informed","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبَّأَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","tr":"bihi","en":"about it"},{"ar":"وَأَظْهَرَهُ","tr":"wa-aẓharahu","en":"and made it apparent","root":"ظهر","lem":"أَظْهَرَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"to him"},{"ar":"عَرَّفَ","tr":"ʿarrafa","en":"he made known","root":"عرف","lem":"عَرَّفَ"},{"ar":"بَعْضَهُۥ","tr":"baʿḍahu","en":"a part of it","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"وَأَعْرَضَ","tr":"wa-aʿraḍa","en":"and avoided","root":"عرض","lem":"أَعْرَضَ"},{"ar":"عَنۢ","tr":"ʿan","en":"[of]"},{"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۖ","tr":"baʿḍin","en":"a part","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"فَلَمَّا","tr":"falammā","en":"Then when"},{"ar":"نَبَّأَهَا","tr":"nabba-ahā","en":"he informed her","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبَّأَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","tr":"bihi","en":"about it"},{"ar":"قَالَتْ","tr":"qālat","en":"she said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"Who"},{"ar":"أَنۢبَأَكَ","tr":"anba-aka","en":"informed you","root":"نبأ","lem":"أَنۢبَأَ"},{"ar":"هَـٰذَا ۖ","tr":"hādhā","en":"this"},{"ar":"قَالَ","tr":"qāla","en":"He said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"نَبَّأَنِىَ","tr":"nabba-aniya","en":"Has informed me","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبَّأَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","tr":"l-ʿalīmu","en":"the All-Knower","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِيم"},{"ar":"ٱلْخَبِيرُ","tr":"l-khabīru","en":"the All-Aware","root":"خبر","lem":"خَبِير"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"إِن تَتُوبَآ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ فَقَدْ صَغَتْ قُلُوبُكُمَا ۖ وَإِن تَظَـٰهَرَا عَلَيْهِ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ مَوْلَىٰهُ وَجِبْرِيلُ وَصَـٰلِحُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ ظَهِيرٌ","en":"If you two [wives] repent to Allāh, [it is best], for your hearts have deviated. But if you cooperate against him - then indeed Allāh is his protector, and Gabriel and the righteous of the believers and the angels, moreover, are [his] assistants.","w":[{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"If"},{"ar":"تَتُوبَآ","tr":"tatūbā","en":"you both turn","root":"توب","lem":"تابَ"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"فَقَدْ","tr":"faqad","en":"so indeed"},{"ar":"صَغَتْ","tr":"ṣaghat","en":"(are) inclined","root":"صغو","lem":"صَغَتْ"},{"ar":"قُلُوبُكُمَا ۖ","tr":"qulūbukumā","en":"your hearts","root":"قلب","lem":"قَلْب"},{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"but if"},{"ar":"تَظَـٰهَرَا","tr":"taẓāharā","en":"you backup each other","root":"ظهر","lem":"تَظاهَرُ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"against him"},{"ar":"فَإِنَّ","tr":"fa-inna","en":"then indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"He"},{"ar":"مَوْلَىٰهُ","tr":"mawlāhu","en":"(is) his Protector","root":"ولي","lem":"مَوْلَى"},{"ar":"وَجِبْرِيلُ","tr":"wajib'rīlu","en":"and Jibreel"},{"ar":"وَصَـٰلِحُ","tr":"waṣāliḥu","en":"and (the) righteous","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِح"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ","tr":"l-mu'minīna","en":"believers","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"},{"ar":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","tr":"wal-malāikatu","en":"and the Angels","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلَك"},{"ar":"بَعْدَ","tr":"baʿda","en":"after","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعْد"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"ظَهِيرٌ","tr":"ẓahīrun","en":"(are his) assistants","root":"ظهر","lem":"ظَهِير"}]},{"n":5,"juz":28,"ar":"عَسَىٰ رَبُّهُۥٓ إِن طَلَّقَكُنَّ أَن يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ أَزْوَٰجًا خَيْرًا مِّنكُنَّ مُسْلِمَـٰتٍ مُّؤْمِنَـٰتٍ قَـٰنِتَـٰتٍ تَـٰٓئِبَـٰتٍ عَـٰبِدَٰتٍ سَـٰٓئِحَـٰتٍ ثَيِّبَـٰتٍ وَأَبْكَارًا","en":"Perhaps his Lord, if he divorced you [all], would substitute for him wives better than you - submitting [to Allāh], believing, devoutly obedient, repentant, worshipping, and traveling - [ones] previously married and virgins.","w":[{"ar":"عَسَىٰ","tr":"ʿasā","en":"Perhaps","root":"عسي","lem":"عَسَى"},{"ar":"رَبُّهُۥٓ","tr":"rabbuhu","en":"his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"if"},{"ar":"طَلَّقَكُنَّ","tr":"ṭallaqakunna","en":"he divorced you","root":"طلق","lem":"طَلَّقَ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"[that]"},{"ar":"يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ","tr":"yub'dilahu","en":"He will substitute for him","root":"بدل","lem":"يُبْدِلَ"},{"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًا","tr":"azwājan","en":"wives","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","tr":"kha